<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/UnitOfMeasure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "UnitofMeasure specify information structures through industry standards for Units of Measure, Quantity Kinds, Dimensions and Data Types."@en .
